[00:07.03]When you tell me that you love me every night
[00:07.03]当你每晚都说你爱我
[00:14.65]When you tell me everything will be alright
[00:14.65]当你告诉我一切都会好的
[00:22.16]When you tell me that the sky could fall
[00:22.16]当你告诉我天可能塌下来
[00:26.12]That you'd still be there through it all
[00:26.12]但你仍会一直在我身边
[00:29.98]I know there's something else that's on your mind
[00:29.98]我清楚你心里藏着其他事
[00:37.30]Because you don't even look me in the eyes
[00:37.30]因为你甚至不愿直视我……
[00:42.95]When you tell me
[00:42.95]当你告诉我的时候
[00:45.05]Oh, you don't even believe the lies that you sell me
[00:45.05]你甚至自己都不相信你对我撒的谎
[00:53.07]I know that you're leaving, so just say goodbye
[00:53.07]我知道你要离开了，那就说个再见吧
[00:56.85]I don't need a reason, I won't be surprised
[00:56.85]我不需要理由，我不感到惊讶
[01:00.00]When you tell me that you need to find yourself
[01:00.00]当你告诉我你需要寻找自我
